# The laboratory contract runs these under bash on every platform, and the
# gate compares rengrep against grep on the same bytes, so everything text
# stays LF and the corpus under tests/ is the same on every machine. The
# conversion never adds a final newline, so notrailing.txt keeps its
# missing one.
*.asm    text eol=lf
*.c      text eol=lf
*.h      text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
*.sh     text eol=lf
*.txt    text eol=lf
